<item>
  <title>Isle of Grain LNG</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/isle-grain-lng</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/isle-grain-lng" hreflang="en"&gt;Isle of Grain LNG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Four 190,000m³&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;LNG storage tanks&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;1000 MMSCFD&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;increase in sendout then&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;700 MMSCFD&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;12,000m³/hr&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;addition&amp;nbsp;trans-shipment&amp;nbsp;facilities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Conversion of existing LNG Peak shaving facility to LNG import terminal&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Multiple brownfield expansions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Was the world’s largest above-ground LNG full containment tank (190,000m3) at the time of project execution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Total of 1700 MMSCFD send out capacity&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The multiple expansions carried out at the Isle of Grain facility converted the existing peak-shaving facility into a large import terminal with the flexibility to achieve send out, trans-shipment, and road tanker exports. The facilities added included marine works, LNG storage, 4 x 190,00m3 storage tanks, regasification and sendout systems, pipelines, loading facilities, buildings and all support systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Regasification&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2026-01/Isle%20of%20Grain%20%283%29%20%281%29.png.webp?itok=JU-zR5DS" width="864" height="576" alt="Isle of Grain LNG Project" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
      
  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-location field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Location&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;United Kingdom&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-scope field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Scope&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;FEED &amp;amp; EPC&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
